\ compute.ga - one node computing, with no ports, for the F18's opcodes
\ alone: five million passes of a loop of arithmetic, then the low byte of
\ the result on the console

: main
    up b!
    1 2499 for 1999 for dup 2* + 1 xor next next
    !b
    left b! @b             \ left faces off the west edge, so wait forever
